silm:instances_papers_18_presheaf_semantics_02_mittens_anchor_yoneda_hom_leg_2_iota_domestic silm:hasExample "In 'P1802_mittens_anchorYonedaHomLeg2', the typed legs of the Yoneda hom-profile are witnessed by concrete Mittens-domain arrows. For example, cocone leg iota_domestic: D_Mittens(DomesticCat) -> L_Mittens carrying the domestic-cat classification into the apex" .
